{'symbol': 'DOW', 'date': '2022-05-31 08:00:00', 'title': 'DOW TO PARTICIPATE IN THE BERNSTEIN 38TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE', 'text': 'MIDLAND, MICH. , MAY 31, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JIM FITTERLING , CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF DOW\xa0INC. (NYSE: DOW), WILL PARTICIPATE IN A FIRESIDE CHAT DURING THE BERNSTEIN 38TH ANNUAL STRATEGIC DECISIONS CONFERENCE ON THURSDAY, JUNE 2 AT 8:00 A.M.'}